<div class="content content04 clearfix">

    <div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12" style="padding-right: 1.5vh;">
        <div class="mod01 mod04">
            <div class="mod_title mod_title04 newline">三峡16MW漂浮式风电项目-远距离拖航监控保障系统</div>
            <div class="mod_content clearfix">
                <div class="img_box img_box04"><img src="~/Content/WindRedirect/img/towingPic.png"></div>
